  "decision": "no_go",
  "decision_scope": "Single authorized correction round of SPAR3D: generated body references and paired image-only/approximate multiview shape-prior variants. Not a verdict on every native multiview model.",
  "production_ready": false,
  "user_visual_approval": "pending",
  "summary": "Eight volumetric TABI reference images were generated and two actual SPAR3D correction variants reviewed in Blender. The image-only front is recognizable, but side/back anatomy and textures remain unsuitable. Supplying a silhouette-derived point cloud increases overall depth while introducing bulky gills/headphones, a thick merged tail/body and smeared rear textures. Neither variant qualifies for reusable animation. The reference pack is preserved; this correction closes the bounded SPAR3D trial, not the broader search for a reliable workflow.",
  "master_sha256": "f8e50e70940df7173ec6c21b7d43d5a689b27444942176ae0e334abf8f7591fd",
